### **Goal Model Decomposition**

---

#### **Goal Table**

| Name       | Text                                                                 | Runtime              | Goal Type | Relation | Justification                                                                 |
|------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------|----------------------|-----------|----------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| G1         | Deliver food from kitchen to inpatient room                            | `;`                  | Perform   | AND      | All sub-goals (receiving order, navigation, delivery, retrieval, dish collection) must be fulfilled. |
| G2         | Receive delivery request from kitchen                                  | `-`                  | Query     | AND      | Required to initiate the mission.                                               |
| G3         | Deliver food to inpatient room                                         | `FALLBACK(G3.1, G3.2)` | Perform   | OR       | Either place on table or allow retrieval (fallback if retrieval fails).        |
| G3.1       | Place food on inpatient room table                                     | `-`                  | Perform   | AND      | Required if retrieval is not feasible.                                          |
| G3.2       | Allow inpatient or others to retrieve food from robot tray             | `;`                  | Perform   | AND      | Requires checking feasibility (G4) and then executing retrieval tasks.         |
| G4         | Check if inpatient or others can retrieve food                         | `-`                  | Query     | AND      | Required to determine whether G3.1 or G3.2 is executed.                        |
| G5         | Retrieve dirty dishes from inpatient room                              | `FALLBACK(G5.1, G5.2)` | Perform   | OR       | Either unassisted, with two robots, or with human assistance (fallback).       |
| G5.1       | Retrieve dishes unassisted                                             | `-`                  | Perform   | AND      | If no cooperation is needed.                                                   |
| G5.2       | Retrieve dishes with cooperation (two robots or human)                 | `-`                  | Perform   | AND      | Required if unassisted retrieval fails.                                        |
| G6         | Check if someone in the room can open the door                         | `-`                  | Query     | AND      | Required to determine whether dish retrieval requires assistance.              |

